<title>SWEDEN: Volvo says U.S. car sales up 20.4 pct Dec.</title>
<headline>Volvo says U.S. car sales up 20.4 pct Dec.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish automotive group AB Volvo said on Friday that its U.S. car sales rose 20.4 percent in December and 0.6 percent in the full year 1996.  </p>
<p>In December, the car maker sold 5,030 cars in the U.S., while its 1996 U.S. car sales totalled 87,586 vehicles, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
